### 1. Get all students
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get all registrations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/registrations
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get one registration
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/registrations/1
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Accept: application/json